<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 11.4 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 11.4 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 11.4 percent of the workforce in July from 11.6 percent in June, Labour Minister Tadeusz Zielinski told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>He gave no further details. The number of jobless in June was 2.04 million people.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
